{"id":"4d5075bfcb91a90c","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-strong-array.md","title":"强数组与有限集的规范编码","display":"df-strong-array — 强数组与有限集的规范编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-strong-array","aliases":["43-df-strong-array"],"display":"df-strong-array — 强数组与有限集的规范编码","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.14, strong-array paragraph before Lemma 5.14.4","source_printed_pages":"59","source_pdf_pages":"79","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-strong-array"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-strong-array</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strong-array — 强数组与有限集的规范编码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.14, strong-array paragraph before Lemma 5.14.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"59"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"79"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(F_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(F=(F_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>，仅用于下式自然数到自然数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_e\\coloneqq\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:\\lfloor e/2^j\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_e\\coloneqq\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:\\lfloor e/2^j\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\iff\n\\left(\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(f)\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F_i=D_{f(i)})\\right)\\right)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F_i\\ne\\varnothing)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow F_i\\cap F_j=\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\iff\n\\left(\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(f)\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F_i=D_{f(i)})\\right)\\right)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F_i\\ne\\varnothing)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow F_i\\cap F_j=\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>二进制位编码给出每个有限集唯一的自然数代码。强数组要求能够有效取得整个有限集，而不只是逐项判断成员关系。显式要求各项非空：书中使用max F_i已隐含此条件；允许空项会使后面的超免疫条件退化。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，§5.14, strong-array paragraph before Lemma 5.14.4，印刷页59，PDF页79。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F=(F_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}$；$e,j\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]]，仅用于下式自然数到自然数的 $f$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F=(F_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"e,j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"D_e\\coloneqq\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:\\lfloor e/2^j\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\iff\n\\left(\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(f)\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F_i=D_{f(i)})\\right)\\right)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(F_i\\ne\\varnothing)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow F_i\\cap F_j=\\varnothing).","display":true}],"bytes":1724,"backlinks":[{"id":"a33ab576c20ae1c1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$F$ 量化于 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\operatorname{StrongArray}$ 见 [[43-df-strong-array]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-strong-array]] — 强数组与有限集的规范编码"},{"id":"9167d626040602f0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Hypersimple}$、$\\operatorname{Simple}$、$\\operatorname{Immune}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-hypersimple]]、[[43-df-immune]]；强数组见 [[43-df-strong-array]]。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a"]}